abstract: >-
  Three adversarial-vetted structural novelties produced via
  Fold-First Ranking methodology on 2026-08-14. (1) Causal
  Information Horizons: every causal system has an irreducible
  boundary beyond which causal relationships cannot be observed
  or reconstructed. (2) Temporal Informational Singularity for
  Qualia: subjective experience is the signature of irreducible
  self-referential information in the temporal domain. (3)
  Informational as Active Cascade Medium: information is not a
  passive substrate but an active medium that shapes the
  possibility space of causal cascades.
